        "subject": "LU-10026 osc: mem leak in compress_request",
        "message": "LU-10026 osc: mem leak in compress_request\n\n1. Fix memory leak in compress_request.\n2. In case of ENOMEM compress_request should return 0\nif it has been able successfully compress at least\none chunk.\n\nosc: fix OBD_FAIL_OSC_COMPR_ENOMEM\n\nSet cfs_fail_loc to OBD_FAIL_OSC_COMPR_ENOMEM to\nalways fail with ENOMEM after skipping fail_val times.\n\nSeveral cosmetic changes in sanity-compr test_2002 to address\nreview comments on an earlier version.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-11120\nSigned-off-by: Sergey Cheremencev <scherementsev@ddn.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I745e17978d885d40218efe13e68e7e41b4b33d31\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
